SUMMARY:Peter Pan Syndrome
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the tales of J.M. Barrie\, Dmitry Krymov's "Peter P
 an. Syndrome" is about art and the artist – the creator who\, even when 
 trapped in a dead end\, when despair tightens around the throat and the ur
 ge to abandon everything feels unbearable\, still returns to creation. Ove
 rcoming pain\, he\, like Peter Pan\, cannot grow up from his passion for a
 rt\; he continues to make miracles because he knows no other way to live. 
 You want to let him go\, to say\, "Rest!" – but he is so radiant\, his m
 iracles so beautiful\, and his heart so full of love that the audience\, w
 eeping\, cannot bring themselves to release him.\nhttps://www.westnewtonci
 nema.com/movie/peter-pan-syndrome\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.ci
 ty/boston/
